## 3. Academic Integrity & Fair Use Notice

This repository is shared publicly to support self-study, practical understanding, and peer learning. Students referencing this repository are expected to uphold their academic institution's integrity and honor code:
- Use this repository as a learning guide to understand the procedures, mathematics, and packet analyses.
- Execute and reproduce the laboratory experiments independently on your own system.
- Do not submit these materials verbatim as your own uncredited academic work.
